    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1039">

                <pb facs="1295" n="1281" sameAs="frus:frus1945v09/pg1281"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 E.W./2–845: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to the President of Paraguay</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Morínigo</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-02-08">February 8,
                        1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Paraguay’s declaration of the existence of a state of war with the Axis is
                    further testimony of western hemisphere unity in the United Nations war against
                    aggression. Please accept my personal best wishes.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Franklin D. Roosevelt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
